bbcode_enabled = true
bbcode_text = "[center][b]Hi everyone,
We are back with some more adjustments!!
Have fun :)

- Doro and Mario
[/b][/center]

[b]Balancing[/b]
[center][b]Neutral[/b][/center]
o Katana: Cooldown 1.7s -> 1.5s
o Boiling Pot: Heal per food 2 -> 3
o Stankus’ Toothpick: Speed per food 12% -> 15%
o Spicy Banana: Heat chance 65% -> 75%
o Smithing for Dummies: Stamina reduction 35% -> 40%
o Uniquely Unique: Speed per treasure or card 10% -> 12%
o Knife to Meet You: Triggers faster per dagger 60% -> 75%
o Time Melting: Effect durations bonus 60% -> 55%
o Wolf Badge: Battle Rage duration 5s -> 5.5s

[center][b]Multiclass[/b][/center]
o Hogus Bogus: Max stamina usage 8 -> 6. Self Stun 0.5s -> 0.8s
o Energy Conversion: Cooldown 4.5s -> 4.7s
o Bewitchment: Cooldown 3s -> 2.5s

[center][b]Ranger[/b][/center]
o Forest Dragon: Damage per regen 0.8 -> 0.7
o Yggdrasil Leaf: Heal 18 -> 20
o Wisp (Weapon) Spikes threshold 30 -> 32
o Critwood Staff: Duration 1.5s -> 1.6s
o Fortuna’s Hope: Luck chance 85% -> 90%

[center][b]Reaper[/b][/center]
o Snake: Maximum health 40 -> 38
o Relic Case: Cooldown 2.3s -> 2.2s

[center][b]Pyromancer[/b][/center]
o Staff of Fire: Damage +2

[center][b]Berserker[/b][/center]
o Deerwood Guardian: Mana 3 -> 4
o Duffle Bag: Battle Rage duration 5s -> 5.5s
o Busted Blade: Battle Rage stamina usage 3 -> 2.5
o Dragonskin Boots: Block 20 -> 25
o Chain Whip: Heal 15 -> 17
o Dragonscale Armor: Block 45 -> 55
o Extra Angy: Delay 1s -> 0.5s

[center][b]Mage[/b][/center]
o Scholar Bag: Mana duplication chance 30% -> 40%
o Rainbow Potion: Buffs per staff 6 -> 7
o Cat Spirit Companion: Cooldown 2.4s -> 2.1s

[center][b]Adventurer[/b][/center]
o Fedora: Cooldown 2.8s -> 3.2s. Chance based effects bonus 25% -> 20%.
o Mercury Elemental: Cooldown 5s -> 4.5s
o Dragon Knight: Heal 8 -> 7
o Piggy of Riches: Maximum health 4 -> 3
o Boomerang: Stamina cost 1.5 -> 1.7
o Very Long Spear: Maximum damage 12 -> 16
o Scissorswords: Damage +2
o Heart Shield: Damage blocked 17 -> 18
o Level Up: Cooldown 5s -> 5.3s

[center][b]Engineer[/b][/center]
o Toast Goobert: Stamina gained 1.5 -> 1.7
o Electric Torch: Trigger speed 40% -> 45%
o Tesla Coil: Activation delay 5.5s -> 5s
o Poison Grenade: Cooldown advance 1s -> 1.5s
o Spring Loader: Cooldown 7.5s -> 7.2s"
text = "Hi everyone,
We are back with some more adjustments!!
Have fun :)

- Doro and Mario


Balancing
Neutral
o Katana: Cooldown 1.7s -> 1.5s
o Boiling Pot: Heal per food 2 -> 3
o Stankus’ Toothpick: Speed per food 12% -> 15%
o Spicy Banana: Heat chance 65% -> 75%
o Smithing for Dummies: Stamina reduction 35% -> 40%
o Uniquely Unique: Speed per treasure or card 10% -> 12%
o Knife to Meet You: Triggers faster per dagger 60% -> 75%
o Time Melting: Effect durations bonus 60% -> 55%
o Wolf Badge: Battle Rage duration 5s -> 5.5s

Multiclass
o Hogus Bogus: Max stamina usage 8 -> 6. Self Stun 0.5s -> 0.8s
o Energy Conversion: Cooldown 4.5s -> 4.7s
o Bewitchment: Cooldown 3s -> 2.5s

Ranger
o Forest Dragon: Damage per regen 0.8 -> 0.7
o Yggdrasil Leaf: Heal 18 -> 20
o Wisp (Weapon) Spikes threshold 30 -> 32
o Critwood Staff: Duration 1.5s -> 1.6s
o Fortuna’s Hope: Luck chance 85% -> 90%

Reaper
o Snake: Maximum health 40 -> 38
o Relic Case: Cooldown 2.3s -> 2.2s

Pyromancer
o Staff of Fire: Damage +2

Berserker
o Deerwood Guardian: Mana 3 -> 4
o Duffle Bag: Battle Rage duration 5s -> 5.5s
o Busted Blade: Battle Rage stamina usage 3 -> 2.5
o Dragonskin Boots: Block 20 -> 25
o Chain Whip: Heal 15 -> 17
o Dragonscale Armor: Block 45 -> 55
o Extra Angy: Delay 1s -> 0.5s

Mage
o Scholar Bag: Mana duplication chance 30% -> 40%
o Rainbow Potion: Buffs per staff 6 -> 7
o Cat Spirit Companion: Cooldown 2.4s -> 2.1s

Adventurer
o Fedora: Cooldown 2.8s -> 3.2s. Chance based effects bonus 25% -> 20%.
o Mercury Elemental: Cooldown 5s -> 4.5s
o Dragon Knight: Heal 8 -> 7
o Piggy of Riches: Maximum health 4 -> 3
o Boomerang: Stamina cost 1.5 -> 1.7
o Very Long Spear: Maximum damage 12 -> 16
